<title>USA: Zions completes buy of 27 Wells branches.</title>
<headline>Zions completes buy of 27 Wells branches.</headline>
<dateline>SALT LAKE CITY 1997-07-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Zions Bancorp has completed its acquisition of 27 former branches of Wells Fargo Bank in Arizona, Idaho, Nevada, and Utah.</p>
<p>It said the acquisition included $378 million in deposit accounts and the branch facilities.</p>
<p>Terms of the deal were not disclosed in a company statement issued Saturday.</p>
<p>Zions said four additional branches it agreed to buy from Wells Fargo Bank in Cedar City, St. George, Logan, and North Logan, Utah still await regulatory approval.</p>
</text>
